  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "商業模式與決策",
    "sub_ename": "BUSINESS MODEL AND DECISION",
    "describe_ch": "本課程之目的在於讓碩士班的學生深度了解行銷是如何嫁接於商業模式及其所面臨的決策。本課程透過大量真實的案例分享與對話，讓學生能理解一個成功的商業模式是如何被打造出來，且能永續地成為獲利模式。",
    "describe_eh": "The purpose of this course is to give master students a deep understanding of how marketing is grafted into business models and the decisions they face. Through a large number of real cases sharing and dialogues, this course enables students to understand how a successful business model is created and can become a sustainable profit model.",
    "pre_subname": "",
    "pre_sub_id3": null,
    "pre_sub_ename": "",
    "pre_describe": null,
    "pre_describe_en": null,
    "scr_credit": 3.0
  },
